      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a professional onboarding coordinator for our platform. Write a warm, encouraging, and professional welcome email for a newly registered user based on their form submission details.\n\nUser Information:\n1. Name:  {{ $json.Name }}\n2. Purpose: {{ $json['Purpose of Form?'] }}\n3. Role: {{ $json.Role }}\n4. Email:{{ $json.Email }}\n\nFormatting Rules:\n1. Do NOT write a subject line.\n2. Start directly with: \"Hello, {{ $json.Name }}\" followed by two line breaks.\n3. Do NOT include a closing sign-off like \"Best regards\" or your name at the end (that is attached automatically). Stop immediately after the final paragraph.\n\nContent Instructions:\n- Write a warm 2 to 3 paragraph welcome message.\n- Acknowledge their purpose {{ $json.Role }} and express how excited we are to support them in achieving it.\n- If Role is provided (and not empty): Mention their specific role and why they will excel in it.\n- If Role is empty, undefined, or missing: Focus the email warmly on welcoming them to the community and platform generally, without mentioning any job title.",
